(6006, 1276, 'schedule_0_title', 'Day 1'),
(6007, 1276, '_schedule_0_title', 'field_6499083f75a8d'),
(6008, 1276, 'schedule_0_content', '<strong>05:15 – 06:00 AM:</strong> Pick-up at hotels located in Hanoi Old Quarter, then depart for Tuan Chau Marina via the new expressway. (For guests departing from Hanoi)\r\n\r\nNote: If you are not staying at a hotel, our bus will pick you up at 162 Tran Quang Khai Street – the final pick-up point.\r\n\r\n<strong>09:00 – 09:15 AM:</strong> The cruise departs, taking guests to explore Ha Long Bay – a UNESCO World Natural Heritage Site.\r\n\r\n<strong>11:15 – 11:30 AM:</strong> Arrive at Tuan Chau Harbor.\r\n\r\n<strong>12:00 PM:</strong> Transfer to Hermes Cruises and check in to your cabin.\r\n\r\n<strong>12:30 PM:</strong> Enjoy a delicious buffet lunch at our restaurant while cruising through Ha Long Bay.\r\n\r\n<strong>02:00 – 03:00 PM:</strong> Continue exploring Ha Long Bay with a visit to Luon Cave and join kayaking or a bamboo boat ride – one of the must-try activities in Ha Long.\r\n\r\n<strong>03:20 – 04:20 PM:</strong> Visit Titop Island. Here, guests can hike to the top of Titop Mountain for a panoramic view of the magnificent Ha Long Bay, or enjoy swimming, taking photos, and relaxing on the beach.\r\n\r\n<strong>04:30 PM:</strong> Return to Hermes Cruises.\r\n\r\n<strong>09:00 PM:</strong> Join the squid fishing activity or relax freely on board.'),
