(6085, 1279, 'schedule_0_content', '<b>8:00-8:45: </b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Check in Ambassadore’s Lounge and transfer to Ambassadore Cruise II </span>\r\n\r\n<b>09:00 - 10:00: </b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Enjoy light breakfast while the Ambassador Cruise passes by thousands of majestic limestone islets in Halong Bay and Bai Tu Long Bay. </span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><strong>10:30-12:00:</strong> Explore Sung Sot cave - the largest and most magnificent cave in the bay featuring marvelous and mysterious thousand year old stalactites in a variety of unique forms.</span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">After visit Sung Sot Cave you will keep going to visit Titov Island - a splendid destination encompassing a crescent moon - shaped beach, where you can immerse yourself in the turquoise water and climb to the top of the Island beholding the breathtaking 360 view of the bay.</span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><strong>12:00-14:00:</strong> Savor a premium lunch  while Ambassador Cruise passes by famous beautiful landscapes in Halong Bay. </span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><strong>13:30-14:30:</strong> Discover Luon Cave - one of the most unique caves in Halong Bay featuring the self - contained lake inside a closed arch - shaped mountain, where you can experience sitting on a bamboo boat * rowed by a local or kayaking*. (Kindly sign up and pay at reception area before 01:30PM). </span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><strong>14:30-15:30:</strong> Enjoy afternoon tea in the restaurant areas on the 3rd and 4th floors. </span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><strong>15:30-16:00:</strong> Relax with live music performance on the sundeck when the cruise returning the harbor.  (In case of unfavorable weather, the performance will be held inside the restaurant area). </span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><strong>16:00-16:15:</strong> Disembark at Halong International Cruise Port. </span>'),
