(301, 6, '2023-06-30 03:50:18', '2023-06-30 03:50:18', '<div class=\"row form-lh\">\r\n<div class=\"col large-6\">\r\n<label>Full Name</label>\r\n[text ht]\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col large-6\">\r\n<label>Phone Number</label>\r\n[tel sdt]\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col large-6\">\r\n<label>Email</label>\r\n[email email]\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col large-6\">\r\n<label>How can we help you?</label>\r\n[text hotro]\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col large-12\">\r\n<label>Message</label>\r\n[text tinnhan placeholder \"Your message\"]\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"align-left appointment\">\r\n<button type=\"submit\" class=\"wpcf7-form-control dark has-spinner wpcf7-submit\">\r\nBook a Tour\r\n<span><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/right-arrow-blue.png\"></span>\r\n</button>\r\n</div>\n1\nForm liên hệ\nwordpress@vionistravel.maiatech.com.vn\nmaiatech611@gmail.com\n<div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background:#f4f7fb;padding:30px;\">\r\n\r\n  <div style=\"max-width:650px;margin:auto;background:#ffffff;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.08);\">\r\n\r\n\r\n<!-- HEADER -->\r\n<div style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0ea5e9,#2563eb);padding:30px;text-align:center;color:#fff;\">\r\n  <h1 style=\"margin:0;font-size:28px;\">📩 New Contact Request</h1>\r\n\r\n  <p style=\"margin-top:10px;font-size:14px;opacity:.9;\">\r\n    A customer has submitted a contact request from the website\r\n  </p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<!-- BODY -->\r\n<div style=\"padding:30px;\">\r\n\r\n  <!-- CUSTOMER INFO -->\r\n  <div style=\"margin-bottom:28px;\">\r\n    <h2 style=\"font-size:18px;color:#111827;border-left:4px solid #10b981;padding-left:12px;\">\r\n      Customer Information\r\n    </h2>\r\n\r\n    <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"10\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:15px;\">\r\n\r\n      <tr style=\"background:#f9fafb;\">\r\n        <td style=\"font-weight:bold;width:180px;\">Full Name</td>\r\n        <td>[ht]</td>\r\n      </tr>\r\n\r\n      <tr>\r\n        <td style=\"font-weight:bold;\">Phone Number</td>\r\n        <td>[sdt]</td>\r\n      </tr>\r\n\r\n      <tr style=\"background:#f9fafb;\">\r\n        <td style=\"font-weight:bold;\">Email Address</td>\r\n        <td>[email]</td>\r\n      </tr>\r\n\r\n      <tr>\r\n        <td style=\"font-weight:bold;\">Support Request</td>\r\n        <td>[hotro]</td>\r\n      </tr>\r\n\r\n    </table>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <!-- MESSAGE -->\r\n  <div style=\"margin-bottom:28px;\">\r\n    <h2 style=\"font-size:18px;color:#111827;border-left:4px solid #f59e0b;padding-left:12px;\">\r\n      Customer Message\r\n    </h2>\r\n\r\n    <div style=\"background:#f9fafb;padding:18px;border-radius:10px;margin-top:15px;line-height:1.7;color:#374151;\">\r\n      [tinnhan]\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <!-- DETAILS -->\r\n  <div>\r\n    <h2 style=\"font-size:18px;color:#111827;border-left:4px solid #ef4444;padding-left:12px;\">\r\n      Contact Details\r\n    </h2>\r\n\r\n    <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"10\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:15px;\">\r\n\r\n      <tr style=\"background:#f9fafb;\">\r\n        <td style=\"font-weight:bold;width:180px;\">Submitted Time</td>\r\n        <td>[_date] [_time]</td>\r\n      </tr>\r\n\r\n      <tr>\r\n        <td style=\"font-weight:bold;\">Page URL</td>\r\n        <td>[_url]</td>\r\n      </tr>\r\n\r\n      <tr style=\"background:#f9fafb;\">\r\n        <td style=\"font-weight:bold;\">IP Address</td>\r\n        <td>[_remote_ip]</td>\r\n      </tr>\r\n\r\n    </table>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<!-- FOOTER -->\r\n<div style=\"background:#111827;padding:22px;text-align:center;color:#d1d5db;font-size:13px;\">\r\n  ✈️ VIONIS TRAVEL <br>\r\n  Customer Contact Notification\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n</div>\n\n\n1\n\n\n[_site_title] \"[your-subject]\"\n[_site_title] <quoc890294@gmail.com>\n[your-email]\nNội dung thông điệp:\r\n[your-message]\r\n\r\n-- \r\nEmail này được gửi đến từ form liên hệ của website [_site_title] ([_site_url])\nReply-To: [_site_admin_email]\n\n\n\nXin cảm ơn, form đã được gửi thành công.\nCó lỗi xảy ra trong quá trình gửi. Xin vui lòng thử lại hoặc liên hệ người quản trị website.\nCó một hoặc nhiều mục nhập có lỗi. Vui lòng kiểm tra và thử lại.\nCó lỗi xảy ra trong quá trình gửi. Xin vui lòng thử lại hoặc liên hệ người quản trị website.\nBạn phải chấp nhận điều khoản trước khi gửi form.\nPlease fill out this field.\nThis field has a too long input.\nThis field has a too short input.\nPlease enter a valid email address.\nPlease enter a valid phone number.\nPlease enter a valid number.\nPlease enter a valid date.\nTải file lên không thành công.\nBạn không được phép tải lên file theo định dạng này.\nThe uploaded file is too large.\nTải file lên không thành công.\nPlease enter a date in YYYY-MM-DD format.\nThis field has a too early date.\nThis field has a too late date.\nPlease enter a number.\nThis field has a too small number.\nThis field has a too large number.\nCâu trả lời chưa đúng.\nPlease enter an email address.\nPlease enter a URL.\nPlease enter a telephone number.', 'Form liên hệ', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'form-lien-he', '', '', '2026-06-08 10:40:30', '2026-06-08 03:40:30', '', 0, 'http://soha.gmoweb.com/?post_type=wpcf7_contact_form&#038;p=301', 0, 'wpcf7_contact_form', '', 0),
