and \"satisfaction\" have not just been slogans, but commitments, a guiding principle for all of Safetours\' activities.</span>\r\n[/ux_text]\r\n[gap]\r\n\r\n[row_inner]\r\n\r\n[col_inner span=\"4\" span__sm=\"12\"]\r\n\r\n[button text=\"About us\" style=\"outline\" size=\"larger\" radius=\"35\" expand=\"true\" icon=\"icon-angle-right\"]\r\n\r\n[/col_inner]\r\n[col_inner span=\"4\" span__sm=\"12\" visibility=\"hide-for-medium\"]\r\n\r\n[/col_inner]\r\n[col_inner span=\"4\" span__sm=\"12\" visibility=\"hide-for-medium\"]\r\n\r\n[/col_inner]\r\n\r\n[/row_inner]\r\n\r\n[/col]\r\n[col span=\"2\" span__sm=\"12\" visibility=\"hide-for-medium\"]\r\n\r\n[/col]\r\n[col span=\"4\" span__sm=\"12\"]\r\n\r\n[ux_image id=\"845\" image_size=\"original\" class=\"img-radius phongvt-hieu-ung-toa-hinh\"]\r\n\r\n[/col]\r\n\r\n[/row]\r\n[row width=\"custom\" custom_width=\"1700px\"]\r\n\r\n[col span__sm=\"12\" margin=\"30px 0px 0px 0px\"]\r\n\r\n[ux_text font_size=\"2\" font_size__sm=\"1.45\" font_size__md=\"1.35\" text_align=\"left\" class=\"phongvt-title-main h2\"]\r\n<h2>Explore Yacht Tour</h2>\r\n[/ux_text]\r\n[ux_products style=\"normal\" type=\"row\" width=\"full-width\" columns__sm=\"1\" columns__md=\"2\" show_quick_view=\"0\" equalize_box=\"true\" cat=\"16\" image_height=\"75%\" image_size=\"original\" image_hover=\"zoom\"]\r\n\r\n[/col]\r\n\r\n[/row]\r\n\r\n[/section]\r\n[section label=\"tour-outbound\" class=\"tour-outbound fix-section\"]\r\n\r\n[row]\r\n\r\n[col span=\"5\" span__sm=\"12\" color=\"light\"]\r\n\r\n[gap height=\"120px\" visibility=\"hide-for-medium\"]\r\n\r\n[ux_text font_size=\"1.5\" class=\"tour-outbound__title\"]\r\n<h2>Explore\r\nOverseas tours</h2>\r\n[/ux_text]\r\n[ux_text font_size=\"1.2\" line_height=\"1.5\"] Safetours focuses on every small detail, from selecting a suitable itinerary, to creating unique experiential activities, helping you explore local culture in the most authentic way. [/ux_text]\r\n[gap]\r\n\r\n[button text=\"Explore now\" size=\"larger\" radius=\"38\" icon=\"icon-angle-right\"]\r\n\r\n[/col]\r\n[col span=\"1\" span__sm=\"12\" visibility=\"hide-for-medium\"]\r\n\r\n[/col]\r\n[col span=\"6\" span__sm=\"12\"]\r\n\r\n[ux_products style=\"normal\" columns=\"1\" slider_nav_style=\"simple\" slider_nav_color=\"light\" equalize_box=\"true\" cat=\"21\" orderby=\"rand\" image_height=\"75%\" image_size=\"original\" image_hover=\"zoom\"]\r\n\r\n[/col]\r\n\r\n[/row]\r\n[ux_products style=\"normal\" type=\"row\" col_spacing=\"normal\" columns__sm=\"1\" animate=\"fadeInUp\" equalize_box=\"true\" cat=\"21\" products=\"4\" image_height=\"100%\" image_size=\"original\" image_hover=\"zoom\"]\r\n\r\n[/section]\r\n[section label=\"tour-outbound\" bg=\"892\" bg_size=\"original\" bg_pos=\"36% 0%\"]\r\n\r\n[row]\r\n\r\n[col span=\"5\" span__sm=\"12\" color=\"light\"]\r\n\r\n[gap height=\"220px\" visibility=\"hide-for-medium\"]\r\n\r\n[ux_text font_size=\"1.5\" class=\"phongvt-title-main\"]\r\n<h2>List of\r\nDomestic Tours</h2>\r\n[/ux_text]\r\n[ux_text font_size=\"1.2\" line_height=\"1.5\" text_color=\"rgb(0,0,0)\"] Safetours focuses on every small detail, from selecting a suitable itinerary, to creating unique experiential activities, helping you explore local culture in the most authentic way. [/ux_text]\r\n[gap]\r\n\r\n[button text=\"Explore now\" size=\"larger\" radius=\"38\" icon=\"icon-angle-right\"]\r\n\r\n[/col]\r\n[col span=\"7\" span__sm=\"12\"]\r\n\r\n[ux_products style=\"normal\" type=\"row\" columns=\"2\" equalize_box=\"true\" cat=\"20\" products=\"4\" image_height=\"75%\" image_size=\"original\" image_hover=\"zoom\"]\r\n\r\n[/col]\r\n\r\n[/row]\r\n\r\n[/section]\r\n[section bg=\"920\" bg_size=\"original\" bg_color=\"rgba(244, 244, 244, 0.122)\" bg_overlay=\"rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.552)\" bg_pos=\"71% 0%\" dark=\"true\" class=\"fix-section\"]\r\n\r\n[row]\r\n\r\n[col span__sm=\"12\" margin=\"50px 0px 0px 0px\"]\r\n\r\n[ux_text font_size=\"2\" font_size__sm=\"1.45\" font_size__md=\"1.35\" text_align=\"center\" class=\"phongvt-title-main\"]\r\n<h2>EXPERIENCE TOUR</h2>\r\n[/ux_text]\r\n[ux_products style=\"normal\" columns__sm=\"1\" slider_nav_style=\"simple\" equalize_box=\"true\" cat=\"22\" image_height=\"75%\" image_size=\"original\" image_hover=\"zoom\"]\r\n\r\n[/col]\r\n\r\n[/row]\r\n\r\n[/section]\r\n[section bg=\"892\" visibility=\"hide-for-medium\"]\r\n\r\n[row class=\"padding-bot\"]\r\n\r\n[col span__sm=\"12\" margin=\"40px 0px 0px 0px\"]\r\n\r\n[ux_text font_size=\"2\" font_size__sm=\"1.45\" font_size__md=\"1.35\" text_align=\"center\" class=\"phongvt-title-main h2\"]\r\n<h2>FEEDBACK FROM CUSTOMERS</h2>\r\n[/ux_text]\r\n\r\n[/col]\r\n\r\n[/row]\r\n[row]\r\n\r\n[col span=\"6\" span__sm=\"12\"]\r\n\r\n[testimonial image=\"896\" image_width=\"121\" name=\"Mark Jance\" company=\"Facebook\"]\r\n\r\nTHOUGHTS: The user wants a direct translation from Vietnamese to English.\r\nThe input text is already in English.\r\nThe instruction is \"Translate the following text from Vietnamese to English.\"\r\nIf I provide the original English text, it fulfills the \"exact translation\" requirement vacuously, as the \"translation\" of an English text to English is the text itself.\r\nThe instruction also says \"Return ONLY the exact translation, without quotes, explanations, intro or additional text. Preserve original structure, formatting, case, and punctuation\". This reinforces the idea that I should output *exactly* what I\'m given, as if it were a translation from a Vietnamese text that happened to be identical to the English text.\r\n\r\nSo, the task is effectively to copy the provided text.\r\n\r\n[/testimonial]\r\n\r\n[/col]\r\n[col span=\"6\" span__sm=\"12\"]\r\n\r\n[testimonial image=\"898\" image_width=\"121\" name=\"Mark Jance\" company=\"Facebook\"]\r\n\r\nThis is a FANTASTIC Theme. Do you think that in the next version you could try and have it Multilanguage. Because I have nothing bad to say about this theme. Thank a million!\r\n\r\n[/testimonial]\r\n\r\n[/col]\r\n\r\n[/row]\r\n\r\n[/section]\r\n[section bg=\"563\" bg_size=\"original\" bg_overlay=\"rgba(238, 224, 224, 0.331)\" bg_pos=\"57% 0%\" border=\"0px 0px 0px 0px\"]\r\n\r\n[row]\r\n\r\n[col span__sm=\"12\" margin=\"0px 0px -40px 0px\"]\r\n\r\n[row_inner]\r\n\r\n[col_inner span=\"7\" span__sm=\"12\" class=\"appointment\"]\r\n\r\n[gap height=\"90px\" visibility=\"hide-for-medium\"]\r\n\r\n[gap visibility=\"show-for-small\"]\r\n\r\n[ux_text text_align=\"center\" class=\"phongvt-title-main h2\"]\r\n<h2>Connect with Safetours</h2>\r\n[/ux_text]\r\n[contact-form-7 id=\"87\"]\r\n\r\n[/col_inner]\r\n[col_inner span=\"5\" span__sm=\"12\" class=\"appointment\"]\r\n\r\n[ux_image id=\"912\" image_size=\"original\" class=\"phongvt-hieu-ung-toa-hinh\"]\r\n\r\n[/col_inner]\r\n\r\n[/row_inner]\r\n\r\n[/col]\r\n\r\n[/row]\r\n\r\n[/section]\r\n[row]\r\n\r\n[col span__sm=\"12\"]\r\n\r\n[ux_text font_size=\"2\" font_size__sm=\"1.45\" font_size__md=\"1.35\" text_align=\"center\" class=\"phongvt-title-main h2\"]\r\n<h3>Travel Guide</h3>\r\n[/ux_text]\r\n[blog_posts style=\"normal\" columns=\"3\" columns__md=\"1\" slider_nav_style=\"simple\" badge_style=\"square\" excerpt_length=\"26\" show_category=\"text\" image_height=\"65.25%\" image_radius=\"4\" image_size=\"original\" image_hover=\"zoom\" text_align=\"left\"]\r\n\r\n[/col]\r\n\r\n[/row]', 'Homepage', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '1138-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-05-28 14:16:24', '2026-05-28 07:16:24', '', 1138, 'http://localhost/vionis/?p=1203', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
