iple for all of Safetours\' activities.</span></p>\n\n[/ux_text]\n[gap]\n\n[row_inner]\n\n[col_inner span=\"4\" span__sm=\"12\"]\n\n[button text=\"About us\" style=\"outline\" size=\"larger\" radius=\"35\" expand=\"true\" icon=\"icon-angle-right\"]\n\n\n[/col_inner]\n[col_inner span=\"4\" span__sm=\"12\" visibility=\"hide-for-medium\"]\n\n\n[/col_inner]\n[col_inner span=\"4\" span__sm=\"12\" visibility=\"hide-for-medium\"]\n\n\n[/col_inner]\n\n[/row_inner]\n\n[/col]\n[col span=\"2\" span__sm=\"12\" visibility=\"hide-for-medium\"]\n\n\n[/col]\n[col span=\"4\" span__sm=\"12\"]\n\n[ux_image id=\"845\" image_size=\"original\" class=\"img-radius phongvt-hieu-ung-toa-hinh\"]\n\n\n[/col]\n\n[/row]\n[row width=\"custom\" custom_width=\"1700px\"]\n\n[col span__sm=\"12\" margin=\"30px 0px 0px 0px\"]\n\n[ux_text font_size=\"2\" font_size__sm=\"1.45\" font_size__md=\"1.35\" text_align=\"left\" class=\"phongvt-title-main h2\"]\n\n<h2>Explore Yacht Tour</h2>\n[/ux_text]\n[ux_products style=\"normal\" type=\"row\" width=\"full-width\" columns__sm=\"1\" columns__md=\"2\" show_quick_view=\"0\" equalize_box=\"true\" cat=\"42\" image_height=\"75%\" image_size=\"original\" image_hover=\"zoom\"]\n\n\n[/col]\n\n[/row]\n\n[/section]\n[section label=\"tour-outbound\" class=\"tour-outbound fix-section\"]\n\n[row]\n\n[col span=\"5\" span__sm=\"12\" color=\"light\"]\n\n[gap height=\"120px\" visibility=\"hide-for-medium\"]\n\n[ux_text font_size=\"1.5\" class=\"tour-outbound__title\"]\n\n<h2>Explore\r\nOverseas tours</h2>\n[/ux_text]\n[ux_text font_size=\"1.2\" line_height=\"1.5\"]\n\n<p>Vionis Travel focuses on every small detail, from selecting a suitable itinerary, to creating unique experiential activities, helping you explore local culture in the most authentic way.</p>\n\n[/ux_text]\n[gap]\n\n[button text=\"Explore now\" size=\"larger\" radius=\"38\" icon=\"icon-angle-right\"]\n\n\n[/col]\n[col span=\"1\" span__sm=\"12\" visibility=\"hide-for-medium\"]\n\n\n[/col]\n[col span=\"6\" span__sm=\"12\"]\n\n[ux_products style=\"normal\" columns=\"1\" slider_nav_style=\"simple\" slider_nav_color=\"light\" equalize_box=\"true\" cat=\"42\" orderby=\"rand\" image_height=\"75%\" image_size=\"original\" image_hover=\"zoom\"]\n\n\n[/col]\n\n[/row]\n[ux_products style=\"normal\" type=\"row\" col_spacing=\"normal\" columns__sm=\"1\" animate=\"fadeInUp\" equalize_box=\"true\" cat=\"42\" products=\"4\" image_height=\"100%\" image_size=\"original\" image_hover=\"zoom\"]\n\n\n[/section]\n[section label=\"tour-outbound\" bg=\"892\" bg_size=\"original\" bg_pos=\"36% 0%\"]\n\n[row]\n\n[col span=\"5\" span__sm=\"12\" color=\"light\"]\n\n[gap height=\"220px\" visibility=\"hide-for-medium\"]\n\n[ux_text font_size=\"1.5\" class=\"phongvt-title-main\"]\n\n<h2>List of\r\nDomestic Tours</h2>\n[/ux_text]\n[ux_text font_size=\"1.2\" line_height=\"1.5\" text_color=\"rgb(0,0,0)\"]\n\n<p>Vionis Travel focuses on every small detail, from selecting a suitable itinerary, to creating unique experiential activities, helping you explore local culture in the most authentic way.</p>\n\n[/ux_text]\n[gap]\n\n[button text=\"Explore now\" size=\"larger\" radius=\"38\" icon=\"icon-angle-right\"]\n\n\n[/col]\n[col span=\"7\" span__sm=\"12\"]\n\n[ux_products style=\"normal\" type=\"row\" columns=\"2\" equalize_box=\"true\" cat=\"42\" products=\"4\" image_height=\"75%\" image_size=\"original\" image_hover=\"zoom\"]\n\n\n[/col]\n\n[/row]\n\n[/section]\n[section bg=\"920\" bg_size=\"original\" bg_color=\"rgba(244, 244, 244, 0.122)\" bg_overlay=\"rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.552)\" bg_pos=\"71% 0%\" dark=\"true\" class=\"fix-section\"]\n\n[row]\n\n[col span__sm=\"12\" margin=\"50px 0px 0px 0px\"]\n\n[ux_text font_size=\"2\" font_size__sm=\"1.45\" font_size__md=\"1.35\" text_align=\"center\" class=\"phongvt-title-main\"]\n\n<h2>Northern Vietnam Tours</h2>\n\n[/ux_text]\n[ux_products style=\"normal\" columns__sm=\"1\" slider_nav_style=\"simple\" equalize_box=\"true\" cat=\"42,43\" image_height=\"75%\" image_size=\"original\" image_hover=\"zoom\"]\n\n\n[/col]\n\n[/row]\n\n[/section]\n[section bg=\"892\" visibility=\"hide-for-medium\"]\n\n[row class=\"padding-bot\"]\n\n[col span__sm=\"12\" margin=\"40px 0px 0px 0px\"]\n\n[ux_text font_size=\"2\" font_size__sm=\"1.45\" font_size__md=\"1.35\" text_align=\"center\" class=\"phongvt-title-main h2\"]\n\n<h2>FEEDBACK FROM CUSTOMERS</h2>\n[/ux_text]\n\n[/col]\n\n[/row]\n[row]\n\n[col span=\"4\" span__sm=\"12\"]\n\n[testimonial image=\"896\" image_width=\"121\" name=\"Emma Wilson\" company=\"Australia\"]\n\n<p>“Vionis Travel provided an outstanding Vietnam tour experience. The itinerary was well organized, the hotels were comfortable, and the guide was extremely professional. Everything exceeded our expectations.”</p>\n\n\n[/testimonial]\n\n[/col]\n[col span=\"4\" span__sm=\"12\"]\n\n[testimonial image=\"898\" image_width=\"121\" name=\"Sophia Miller\" company=\"Canada\"]\n\n<p>“The Ha Long Bay cruise arranged by Vionis Travel was unforgettable. From transportation to activities, every detail was carefully prepared. Highly recommended for anyone visiting Vietnam.”</p>\n\n\n[/testimonial]\n\n[/col]\n[col span=\"4\" span__sm=\"12\"]\n\n[testimonial image=\"898\" image_width=\"121\" name=\"Daniel Kim\" company=\"South Korea\"]\n\n<p>“Our family trip to Vietnam was fantastic thanks to Vionis Travel. Every part of the journey was organized professionally, from airport transfers to sightseeing activities. The team was responsive, reliable, and always available whenever we needed assistance. It was one of the best travel experiences we’ve ever had.”</p>\n\n\n[/testimonial]\n\n[/col]\n\n[/row]\n\n[/section]\n[section bg=\"563\" bg_size=\"original\" bg_overlay=\"rgba(238, 224, 224, 0.331)\" bg_pos=\"57% 0%\" border=\"0px 0px 0px 0px\"]\n\n[row]\n\n[col span__sm=\"12\" margin=\"0px 0px -40px 0px\"]\n\n[row_inner]\n\n[col_inner span=\"7\" span__sm=\"12\" class=\"appointment\"]\n\n[gap height=\"90px\" visibility=\"hide-for-medium\"]\n\n[gap visibility=\"show-for-small\"]\n\n[ux_text text_align=\"center\" class=\"phongvt-title-main h2\"]\n\n<h2>Connect with Safetours</h2>\n[/ux_text]\n[contact-form-7 id=\"87\"]\n\n\n[/col_inner]\n[col_inner span=\"5\" span__sm=\"12\" class=\"appointment\"]\n\n[ux_image id=\"912\" image_size=\"original\" class=\"phongvt-hieu-ung-toa-hinh\"]\n\n\n[/col_inner]\n\n[/row_inner]\n\n[/col]\n\n[/row]\n\n[/section]\n[row]\n\n[col span__sm=\"12\"]\n\n[ux_text font_size=\"2\" font_size__sm=\"1.45\" font_size__md=\"1.35\" text_align=\"center\" class=\"phongvt-title-main h2\"]\n\n<h3>Travel Guide</h3>\n[/ux_text]\n[blog_posts style=\"normal\" columns=\"3\" columns__md=\"1\" slider_nav_style=\"simple\" badge_style=\"square\" excerpt_length=\"26\" show_category=\"text\" image_height=\"65.25%\" image_radius=\"4\" image_size=\"original\" image_hover=\"zoom\" text_align=\"left\"]\n\n\n[/col]\n\n[/row]', 'Homepage', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '1138-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-05-28 16:30:33', '2026-05-28 09:30:33', '', 1138, 'http://localhost/vionis/?p=1255', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(1256, 6, '2026-05-28 17:35:12', '2026-05-28 10:35:12', '<b>INCLUSION :</b><b> </b>\r\n<ol>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Full transfers Hanoi - Ninh Binh - Hanoi by Thaco Limousine(17-22 Pax)/ Luxury D-Car (9-11 Pax) round trip</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">English Speaking Guide</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">All Entrance fees </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&amp; sharing boat at Tam Coc or Trang An</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">01 bottle of mineral water/1 way on the Thaco Limousine/ Luxury D-Car</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Buffet Lunch for Thaco Limousine option</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Deluxe Set Menu Lunch for </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Luxury</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> D-Car option</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Cycling activity</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Free usage of rain-coat and conical hat during the trip</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<b>EXCLUSION :</b><b> </b>\r\n<ol>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">VAT</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Drinks</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Tips for tour guide &amp; driver and personal expenses</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Holiday surcharges</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">All services and items not mentioned specifically in the list above</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<b>THINGS YOU SHOULD BRING</b>\r\n<ol>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"4\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Hat, umbrella, shoes</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"4\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sun cream, sun glasses</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"4\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Mosquito spray</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"4\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Camera</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<b>CHILDREN POLICY :</b>\r\n<ol>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Child 1-4 years old: Free charge, sharing the service with parents</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Surcharge will be applied If you request a private seat for child from 1-4 years old:</span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">- Luxury D-Car : </span> <span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">16 USD/Seat</span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">- Thaco Limousine : </span> <span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">12 USD/Seat</span>\r\n<ol>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Child from 5 to 8 charge 75% adult and use services as an adult ( Applied for 1 child, the second child will be charged 100% of adult price)</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Child from 09 and above charge as adult</span></li>\r\n</ol>', 'HOA LU – TAM COC (OR TRANG AN) – MUA CAVE- CYCLING', '<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"327\"><span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Hoa Lư</span></span> is a semi-mountainous region featuring many natural landscapes such as the <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Tràng An Scenic Landscape Complex</span></span> and <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Tam Cốc – Bích Động</span></span>, alongside historical relics belonging to the ancient capital complex of Hoa Lư, which has been preserved for more than 1,000 years.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"329\" data-end=\"470\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Tam Cốc – Bích Động, also famously known as “Ha Long Bay on land,” has been recognized as one of Vietnam’s key national tourism destinations.</p>', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'hoa-lu-tam-coc-or-trang-an-mua-cave-cycling', '', '', '2026-06-26 10:37:36', '2026-06-26 03:37:36', '', 0, 'http://localhost/vionis/?post_type=product&#038;p=1256', 0, 'product', '', 0),
